  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "You biggest question on investing cash, position sizing, taking profits, stop losses, stock selection and the meltdown.",
  "body_html": "<p>In my recent survey, I asked you a simple question: “If you could ask me one thing, what would it be?” Questions included:</p><ul><li><p>How I would approach investing $100k or $500k today</p></li><li><p>How many positions I would hold at a time</p></li><li><p>When to take profits </p></li><li><p>How to size positions and manage losses</p></li><li><p>Why I avoid buying 52 week lows</p></li><li><p>Recent thoughts on gold, silver, copper and bond rates</p></li><li><p><strong>When is the meltdown going to happen?</strong></p></li></ul><p>Also, I explain how I built the <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a> and use it to narrow down opportunities.</strong> My answers to all of your questions are below. If you have questions I did not cover, come ask me in the <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/01f94563-c285-45fe-bbbb-a6f64b16e1c5\">Main Chat (click here)</a>.</strong></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
